# Assetforge writes reproducible build products here. Keep compact source fixtures, receipts, and
# positive proof boards; do not grow Git/LFS with every derived atlas or per-state cut.
outputs/
self-test/runs/**/atlas.png
self-test/runs/**/atlas.json
self-test/runs/**/states/
self-test/runs/**/visual-review.json
self-test/runs/**/proof-board.png
!self-test/runs/*/valid/proof-board.png

# Rejected/historical pilots retain their raw return, receipt, proof board, and review decision.
# Their runtime-shaped atlases and state cuts regenerate and are not retained. V003 is the current
# canonical candidate and intentionally remains unignored in full.
